<title>NEW ZEALAND: St Lukes intends selling shopping centre.</title>
<headline>St Lukes intends selling shopping centre.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Lukes Group Ltd said on Thursday it intended to sell the Downtown Shopping Centre in Auckland.</p>
<p>The centre, which has been freeholded, is valued in St Luke's accounts at NZ$27 million.  </p>
<p>Settlement of the land with the Auckland City Council need not be before March 1998, St Lukes said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
